 Terror","textMapHash":309570466,"text":"Onikabuto are our friends! Like cats and doggies!","nextNodeIds":[716663002]},{"nodeId":716663002,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"Arataki Itto","textMapHash":38673626,"text":"Another kid? Ugh, didn't we go through this last time?","nextNodeIds":[716663003]},{"nodeId":716663003,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":155706642,"text":"Well yeah, but Grandmaster Hanakado's a kid too, and one of the other kids from last time was actually pretty good. So age is no measure of a beetle-fighter's skill.","nextNodeIds":[716663004]},{"nodeId":716663004,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30468,"speakerName":"Grandmaster Hanakado","textMapHash":2861026554,"text":"Although... uh, Buttercup of Terror has no prior beetle-battling experience, her chosen Onikabuto has the air of a formidable warrior!","nextNodeIds":[716663005]},{"nodeId":716663005,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30472,"speakerName":"Buttercup of Terror","textMapHash":911933498,"text":"I dunno what you guys are talking about.","nextNodeIds":[716663006]},{"nodeId":716663006,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30472,"speakerName":"Buttercup of Terror","textMapHash":3284607466,"text":"My Onikabuto was a present from Daddy. He got it from a new friend he made last time he was away.","nextNodeIds":[716663007]},{"nodeId":716663007,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"Arataki Itto","textMapHash":3478439058,"text":"Hoho, your father sounds like a real stand up guy!","nextNodeIds":[716663008]},{"nodeId":716663008,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"Arataki Itto","textMapHash":4217411738,"text":"Okay, let's send out Skycleaving White-Iron Lavender Melon for this one. We don't want any accusations of bullying flying around.","nextNodeIds":[716663009]},{"nodeId":716663009,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3411871290,"text":"Hmph, you make it sound like Paimon's the weakest choice on our side...","nextNodeIds":[716663010]},{"nodeId":716663010,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":181321970,"text":"Still, Paimon is probably the safest choice... but only because you two maniacs are a danger to yourselves and others when you're in a competitive mood.","nextNodeIds":[716663011]},{"nodeId":716663011,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2404731706,"text":"Don't be nervous, young lady! It's only a game, so it's just for fun!","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7166630,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":0,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NONE"}}},{"subQuestId":7152602,"order":2,"stepDescription":"","stepDescTextMapHash":2690657036,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7152603,2],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_QUEST_STATE_EQUAL","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":0,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NONE"},"isHidden":false,"talkIds":[7166633],"talks":[{"talkId":7166633,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[]